The classifier fills a missing abstract before it asks, as for a
pending paper ([[enrich_missing]]), and assigns the filled paper to the
decision it shows, as the ordinary run does ([[decision.paper =
enriched_paper]]).  That changes the record's metadata, never the
decision, and it is saved with the screenings.  Of copies under one id
only the first is shown, so the others are given the same filled
paper, as copies under one id share one [[Paper]] when the session is
loaded.  A paper that was not filled is left as it was on every copy.

<<give every copy the paper enrichment filled>>=
for paper_id in chosen:
    filled = copies[paper_id][0].paper
    if filled is not shown[paper_id]:
        for other in copies[paper_id][1:]:
            other.paper = filled
