[[globals()]] seam of the other classifier tests (no model is called).
The session is invented: an unreviewed classifier discard and a
human-confirmed keep, each with a tag and a reason no other record has,
two human decisions that can serve as examples, and a pending paper.
The fake answers every paper in its prompt, with an answer per index
