The model that made the decision screens it again: the run is
recorded and the paper listed as the same model's.  The snapshot and
the second screen both count and are two screeners.  A snapshot taken
before, when an agent screened the paper, does not make the model skip
it: only its own second screen does.  [[machine]] selects the
unreviewed machine decision alone.

